{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "d244c0e25b051378",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "match (tool): every step is code",
			"x": -60,
			"y": -310,
			"width": 2160,
			"height": 670,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "5efcb042d71c29ce",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "design/Entities/Item Map.md",
			"x": -520,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "2f6649524fc2e738",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "or **pages** + `siblings: true`\n(from wiki-rollup): compare each page only with the pages of its sibling scopes",
			"x": -520,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "9e75a1b0aad73cff",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Normalize every name and alias\n(lower case, one space, singular)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "f2ff9327aa51ae38",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Join items into subjects:\nsame type, and an equal name or alias",
			"x": 360,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a83e754899af4237",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "For each subject",
			"x": 720,
			"y": -30,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "797d55cdfe9e54a6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Does a page's title or alias equal a name or alias of the subject?",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": -60,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "8b332c602925c2b7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**hit**\nthe page",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": -250,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "b02083c56f01014b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Does a page score above the threshold on name, aliases, and description?",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": 80,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "f91f2882c5875c11",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**near**\nthe best five pages as neighbors",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": -20,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "b79687b96951cc1b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**new**\nthe best three below the threshold, as related pages",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "71c2af3b73b7f6ea",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "design/Entities/Match Map.md",
			"x": 2160,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "846d128937ad9a6e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "What code does not decide: whether a **near** neighbor is the same subject, and whether a **new** subject deserves a page. That is **wiki-draft**.",
			"x": 2160,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0a97614bac336519",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -520,
			"y": -560,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
